ked the system to text everyone photos of Miriam.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-29\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"The Fake Profile\",\"overview\":\"Linz buddies up to Anna in her office, but unexpected word from Juilliard catches both Anna and Miriam off guard.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-30\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"The Aftermath\",\"overview\":\"Provoked by the news from Juilliard, Miriam opens up to Anna about her real feelings regarding their town and her peers. Anna, however, is most concerned with the fact that Miriam told her dad about the pictures.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-02\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"The Caste System\",\"overview\":\"Bridget calls Anna out for sneaking into the boys' locker room and laughs off what Anna thinks is a new lead with regards to the photo scandal.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-03\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"The Photo Shoot\",\"overview\":\"Chip tells Anna what really happened the night that Miriam posed for the pictures.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-04\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"The Folder\",\"overview\":\"Anna grills Roger about his history with Miriam as well as the process of mass distribution via text message. When Anna inquires about a suspicious folder on his desktop, Roger storms out.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-05\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"The Loudspeaker\",\"overview\":\"While Principal Walsh meets with Miriam's dad, Linz hangs in Anna's office and speculates who is to blame.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-06\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"The #MiriamWorthless\",\"overview\":\"The hashtag #MiriamWorthless is trending on twitter and Bridget berates Miriam in the school parking lot. Anna shows Miriam the recording device that she found in her office, but Miriam is at her breaking point.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-09\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"The Power of Persuasion\",\"overview\":\"Principal Walsh and Anna turn to Chip's phone for evidence, but Anna learns a tough lesson about playing by the rules.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-10\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"The Bug\",\"overview\":\"Miriam reaches out to Mr. Worth to check in on Miriam who's still absent from school. Anna questions Bridget about the microphone she found in her office, but Bridget plays a strong opponent.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-11\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"The App\",\"overview\":\"Anna targets Roger upon reading that Mr. Worth pulled funding for his app, but Roger denies bugging the guidance office. Anna confronts Jim about being aloof, but the conversation doesn't end how Anna would've liked.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-12\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"The Call\",\"overview\":\"Anna vents to Linz about everything she's got on her plate, and Anna finally hears from Mr. Worth but it isn't the kind of call she was expecting.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-13\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"The Rumors\",\"overview\":\"Rumors about what happened to Miriam swirl around school while Roger, Bridget and Chip hash it out in the guidance office.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-14\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"The Bully\",\"overview\":\"Anna confronts Bridget about continuing to torment Miriam on twitter, so Bridget reveals the history at the root of their troubled relationship.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-15\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"The Attention\",\"overview\":\"Anna turns to Linz as she susses out the information at hand. Linz suggests the possibility that Miriam did all of this for attention.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-16\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"The List\",\"overview\":\"Roger provides Anna with a list that may lead her to the person responsible.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-17\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"The House Visit\",\"overview\":\"Anna visits Miriam at home, but Miriam is hardly welcoming. She can't escape the unwanted attention resulting from the seemingly infinite reach of the photos.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-18\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":26,\"name\":\"The Access\",\"overview\":\"Roger explains the significance of his working relationship with Miriam's father and suggests a way someone might have gotten the photos from Miriam and Chip.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-21\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":27,\"name\":\"The Charges\",\"overview\":\"Up against the possibility of serious charges, Chip fears for his future, and he's still distraught over his now broken relationship with Miriam.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-22\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":28,\"name\":\"The Lesson\",\"overview\":\"Back from suspension, Bridget's given up on trying to make sense of the scandal, but Anna offers her good news with regards to the feminist club.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-23\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":29,\"name\":\"The Guilty One\",\"overview\":\"Anna realizes that the primary suspect was right under her nose the entire time.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-24\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":30,\"name\":\"Case Closed\",\"overview\":\"Jim congr